{
  "description": "Issue #11 central state machine: Navigating -> Pumping -> Dosing -> Delivering. Arrival pulses come from navigation (Issue #7), the ROS 2 sim or dashboard buttons. Outputs one-shot pulses that drive the subsystem nodes, and DRV=false inhibits the motors while pumps run. SID matches the Node-RED serial bridge: 0 IDLE 1 NAV_RIVER 2 INTAKE_DOSE 3 NAV_HOMESTEAD 4 DELIVER_WATER 5 EMERGENCY_STOP. ST = detailed state 0-10 (STATE_IDLE ... STATE_EMERGENCY_STOP).",
